<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Burlington Resources.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Burlington Resources.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell Inc said it raised its rating on Burlington Resources Inc to buy from accumulate based on improving fundamentals and stock price upside potential.</p>
<p>-- raised the price target to $68 a share from $57 a share.</p>
<p>-- Burlington Resources gained 5/8 to 54-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
